cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the published article below."
title: "webdb-fairness-analytics: Detecting Infrastructure-Induced Examination Inequality from Moodle Logs"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for identifying internet-induced examination disruption in
  Moodle-based e-examinations from standard gradebook exports, using a
  severity-graded blank-ratio definition and a three-point within-subject
  validation design. Accompanies the published article in Discover Education.
